@database json.guide
@$VER: json.guide 0.1b1 (16.10.2026)
@author Tobias Karlsson

@node main "json.library"

@{b}json.library programmer's guide@{ub}

json.library reads, builds and writes @{b}JSON@{ub}, the text format web services
and many settings files use. It works from C (and any language that can
call a library) and from @{b}ARexx@{ub}.

This guide explains how to use it. Every call is described in full in the
@{"reference" link "reference"}. Complete working programs: tests/jsontest.c (C) and
tests/jsontest.rexx (ARexx).

@{b}The programmer's guide@{ub}

  @{"What you need" link "g-what-you-need"}
  @{"The first program" link "g-the-first-program"}
  @{"How it works" link "g-how-it-works"}
